================================================================================
1. Google Gemma Models
================================================================================

This project uses Google's Gemma family of models, both via the Gemini API
(Gemma 4 26B, `gemma-4-26b-a4b-it`) and as a locally executed quantized GGUF
weight (Gemma 4 Q4_K_M).

Use of Gemma models is governed by the Gemma Terms of Use and the Gemma
Prohibited Use Policy published by Google:

    Gemma Terms of Use:        https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms
    Prohibited Use Policy:     https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy

By downloading, distributing, or running this project together with any Gemma
weight, you agree to comply with these terms. The project author is not
affiliated with Google LLC; "Gemma" and "Gemini" are trademarks of Google LLC.

